{"book":"proverbs","num":4,"verses":[{"en":"Hear, ye children, the instruction of a father, and attend to know understanding.","n":1,"sm":"Faalogo mai ia, outou le fanau e, i le aʻoaʻo atu a le tama, ma uai mai o outou taliga ina ia faaatamamaiina outou.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Faalogo"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fanau"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻoaʻo"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tama,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"uai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"taliga"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faaatamamaiina"},{"en":"","sm":"outou."}]},{"en":"For I give you good doctrine, forsake ye not my law.","n":2,"sm":"Aua ou te avatu ia te outou le poto e lelei; aua ne“ tou tuulafoai i lau upu e aʻoaʻo atu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"avatu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ne“"},{"en":"","sm":"tou"},{"en":"","sm":"tuulafoai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lau"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻoaʻo"},{"en":"","sm":"atu."}]},{"en":"For I was my father's son, tender and only beloved in the sight of my mother.","n":3,"sm":"Aua o au nei, o le atalii o loʻu tama, o le pele toatasi a loʻu tina.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"nei,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"tama,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"pele"},{"en":"","sm":"toatasi"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"tina."}]},{"en":"He taught me also, and said unto me, Let thine heart retain my words: keep my commandments, and live.","n":4,"sm":"Na ia aʻoaʻo mai ia te au, ma na fai mai ia te au, Ia taofi aʻu upu i lou loto, ia tausiusi i aʻu poloaiga e te ola ai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Na"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻoaʻo"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"Ia"},{"en":"","sm":"taofi"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lou"},{"en":"","sm":"loto,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"tausiusi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"poloaiga"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ola"},{"en":"","sm":"ai."}]},{"en":"Get wisdom, get understanding: forget it not; neither decline from the words of my mouth.","n":5,"sm":"Ia maua le poto, ia maua le atamai; aua ne“ galo ia te oe nei mea; aua foi neʻi e liliu ese i upu a loʻu gutu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ia"},{"en":"","sm":"maua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"maua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"atamai;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ne“"},{"en":"","sm":"galo"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"nei"},{"en":"","sm":"mea;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"neʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"liliu"},{"en":"","sm":"ese"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"gutu."}]},{"en":"Forsake her not, and she shall preserve thee: love her, and she shall keep thee.","n":6,"sm":"Aua e te lafoai ia te ia, ona tausia lea o oe e ia; ia e alofa ia te ia, ona leoleoina lea o oe e ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"lafoai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tausia"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia;"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"leoleoina"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"Wisdom is the principal thing; therefore get wisdom: and with all thy getting get understanding.","n":7,"sm":"O le poto o le mea sili lea, ia maua le poto; o mea uma e te mava ia maua mai ai le atamai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"lea,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"maua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"mava"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"maua"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"atamai."}]},{"en":"Exalt her, and she shall promote thee: she shall bring thee to honour, when thou dost embrace her.","n":8,"sm":"Ia e vivii ia te ia, ona faaeaina lea o oe e ia; na te faamamaluina oe pe a e fusi ia te ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"vivii"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"faaeaina"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia;"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faamamaluina"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fusi"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"She shall give to thine head an ornament of grace: a crown of glory shall she deliver to thee.","n":9,"sm":"Na te avatu le pale matagofie i lou ulu; o le palealii