,{"en":"","sm":"laasaga;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"momo'e"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tausuai."}]},{"en":"Take fast hold of instruction; let her not go: keep her; for she is thy life.","n":13,"sm":"la e taofi mau i upu e aʻoaʻoina, aua ne“ tuuina atu; ia e leoleo i ai; aua O lou ola lava lea.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"taofi"},{"en":"","sm":"mau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻoaʻoina,"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ne“"},{"en":"","sm":"tuuina"},{"en":"","sm":"atu;"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"leoleo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ai;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"lou"},{"en":"","sm":"ola"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"lea."}]},{"en":"Enter not into the path of the wicked, and go not in the way of evil men.","n":14,"sm":"Aua e te alu i le ala o e agasala; aua foi e te ui i le ala o e fai amio leaga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ala"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"agasala;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ui"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ala"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga."}]},{"en":"Avoid it, pass not by it, turn from it, and pass away.","n":15,"sm":"la e faamamao i ai, aua neʻi ui atu i ai, ia e “alo ai, ma alu ese.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faamamao"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ai,"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"neʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"ui"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ai,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"“alo"},{"en":"","sm":"ai,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"ese."}]},{"en":"For they sleep not, except they have done mischief; and their sleep is taken away, unless they cause some to fall.","n":16,"sm":"Aua latou te le momoe, se'i iloga ua latou faia se mea leaga; ua aveesea foi o latou moe, pe afai latou te lei faatausuaiina nisi.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"momoe,"},{"en":"","sm":"se'i"},{"en":"","sm":"iloga"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"aveesea"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"moe,"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"afai"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"lei"},{"en":"","sm":"faatausuaiina"},{"en":"","sm":"nisi."}]},{"en":"For they eat the bread of wickedness, and drink the wine of violence.","n":17,"sm":"Aua ua latou aai le areto a le agasala; ua latou inu foi le uaina a le sauaga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"aai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"areto"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"agasala;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"inu"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"uaina"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"sauaga."}]},{"en":"But the path of the just is as the shining light, that shineth more and more unto the perfect day.","n":18,"sm":"A o le ala o e amiotonu, e tusa ia ma le malamalama o le ao, o loo tupu pea lona malamalama e oo i le tutonu o le la.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"A"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ala"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"amiotonu,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"malamalama"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"